  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - Introduces **Static Reflection** with Shadow Types! 🔮\n    - New `[SannrReflect]` attribute generates static \"Shadow Types\" for classes.\n    - Zero-allocation, AOT-compatible property accessors (`GetX`/`SetX`).\n    - Compile-time metadata generation (`TypeName`, `PropertyCount`).\n    - Smart `DeepClone()` support for complex object graphs.\n    - PII-aware property inspection with `[Pii]`.\n    - Generic `Visit` method for high-performance iteration.",
